  "prefLabel": "Ncr 733.06 Digging",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 733.06 Digging. No person shall dig holes on sand beaches unless all resulting holes are completely filled in prior to leaving the site. Digging holes to a depth greater than 12 inches shall not be permitted.\n\nSource. #14055 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14291, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
